{"4445000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wane’s", "steam_appid": 4445000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2007, you play as Carter Harris, a newly hired night watchman assigned to monitor an abandoned animatronic factory. As you investigate what happened after the mysterious closure of Wane's Burgers years earlier, you'll uncover disturbing secrets while trying to survive each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person survival horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor security cameras to track animatronic movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and survive each night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mystery surrounding the factory and its past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique animatronics with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design and tense jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven experience with hidden lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the security cameras, react to animatronic movement, manage your equipment, and survive until morning while uncovering the truth behind the factory.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2007, you play as Carter Harris, a newly hired night watchman assigned to monitor an abandoned animatronic factory. As you investigate what happened after the mysterious closure of Wane's Burgers years earlier, you'll uncover disturbing secrets while trying to survive each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><